&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of relevant experience in FP&amp;amp;A, Strategic Finance, Management Consulting, or Transaction Advisory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Finance, Economics, Business Administration, or a related field, or equivalent relevant professional experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced financial modeling capability and strong data manipulation skills. Experience with AI-enhanced modeling techniques and modern FP&amp;amp;A tooling are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate complex operational and product mechanics into clear financial models and commercial insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management skills, with the ability to constructively challenge assumptions and clearly communicate financial trade-offs to business leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
