&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience inside a regulated business (mobility, fintech, payments) or working through a change-of-control event.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the German labour and works council context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to both acquirer-side and target-side integration work.&lt;/li&gt;
